"scale":1.0,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":7.5,"type":"agent","text":"The model is 16.1 cm across and 7.2 cm tall, so it's cereal-bowl size. The source photos don't show the real bowl's size, so I can't pick the scale myself. Its proportions look right: about 2.2 wide to 1.\n\nCould you measure the real bowl for me?\n1. **Rim diameter** in cm. That's the number I'll scale to.\n2. **Weight**, if you can weigh it. A bowl that size has thicker walls, so it won't be a simple scale-up of 0.42 kg, and I'd rather match the real mass than guess.","state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":8.5,"type":"say","text":"It's a large ceramic serving bowl on a small foot: about 32 cm across and 14 to 15 cm tall, and it weighs around 2 kg.","state":{"scale":1.0,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":12.8,"type":"edit","tool":"set_scale","args":{"factor":1.99},"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":16.7,"type":"edit","tool":"set_shell","args":{"part":"body","thickness":0.008},"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":20.7,"type":"edit","tool":"set_shell","args":{"part":"body","thickness":0.0029},"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":25.7,"type":"tool","tool":"run_probe","args":{"kind":"rest"},"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":26.9,"type":"tool","tool":"run_probe","args":{"kind":"tip"},"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":27.5,"type":"tool","tool":"render","args":{},"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":31.7,"type":"agent","text":"I scaled the bowl up and set its mass to match what you measured.\n\n- **Size:** it's now 32.0 cm across and 14.3 cm tall, which is a 1.99\u00d7 scale of the original.\n- **Weight:** scaling alone made it 3.3 kg. I made the body a hollow porcelain shell with about 2.9 mm walls, so it now weighs 2.0 kg. The wall thickness is my estimate from the model's surface area, not something I measured.\n- **Behaviour:** it sits still on a flat table. On a tilt table it holds up to about 35\u00b0 and topples at 40\u00b0, which seems reasonable for a wide bowl on a small foot.\n\nLift it again and see whether 2 kg and the size feel right next to the real one. If the walls on the real bowl are noticeably thicker or thinner than 3 mm, tell me and I'll adjust.","state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":34.7,"type":"action","action":"lift","text":"It weighs 2.00 kg, about as heavy as a 2 L bottle of soda. It stands 14.3 cm tall and is 32.0 cm by 32.0 cm across.","i":3,"traced":false,"result":{"mass_kg":1.9978,"height_cm":14.3,"across_cm":[32.0,32.0]},"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":36.1,"type":"action","action":"fill","text":"5 of 5 marbles dropped into it stay inside.","i":4,"traced":true,"result":null,"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":36.6,"type":"action","action":"look","text":"Looked at the serving bowl.","i":5,"traced":false,"result":null,"state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}},{"t":36.6,"type":"decision","text":"The contributor approved the object: Looks and feels like the real one now.","state":{"scale":1.99,"removed":[],"collision":{}}}],"traces":{"4":{"kind":"cavity","t":[0.0,0.02,0.04,0.06,0.08,0.1,0.12,0.14,0.16,0.18,0.2,0.22,0.24,0.26,0.28,0.3,0.32,0.34,0.36,0.38,0.4,0.42,0.44,0.46,0.48,0.5,0.52,0.54,0.56,0.58,0.6,0.62,0.64,0.66,0.68,0.7,0.72,0.74,0.76,0.78,0.8,0.82,0.84,0.86,0.88,0.9,0.92,0.94,0.96,0.98,1.0,1.02,1.04,1.06,1.08,1.1,1.12,1.14,1.16,1.18,1.2,1.22,1.24,1.26,1.28,1.3,1.32,1.34,1.36,1.38,1.4,1.42,1.44,1.46,1.48,1.5,1.52,1.54,1.56,1.58,1.6,1.62,1.64,1.66,1.68,1.7,1.72,1.74,1.76,1.78,1.8,1.82,1.84,1.86,1.88,1.9,1.92,1.94,1.96,1.98],"frames":[[[0.0,-0.0,0.07819999754428864,-0.13370999693870544,0.694350004196167,0.13370999693870544,0.694350004196167]],[[0.0,-0.0,0.07819999754428864,-0.13370999693870544,0.694350004196167,0.13370999693870544,0.694350004196167]],[[0.0,-0.0,0.07819999754428864,-0.13370999693870544,0.6943500